config C33_IRAM_BENCH
	bool "Benchmark internal RAM against SDRAM"
	help
	  Times the same loops, string routines and divisions from SDRAM
	  and from A0 RAM, to check wremu's model of both against the
	  device:

	    echo 1 > /sys/module/iram_bench/parameters/run

	  prints one line a case to the kernel log.  It needs about 700
	  bytes of A0 RAM free.  If unsure, say N.
